---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Serviproma Energy · Senior Engineering & Track Record" 
  description="Over 35 years of senior engineering experience in bulk electric power systems, substation automation, and electrical protections."
  lang="en" 
  currentPath="/en/about"
>
  <!-- Hero About Us with Senior Engineering Photography -->
  <section class="relative py-24 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
      <img 
        src="/images/benchmarks/pace-hero-equipo.webp" 
        alt="Senior engineering team in front of high-voltage power transformer" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950/80 via-slate-950/95 to-slate-950"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center max-w-4xl relative z-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3 font-mono">Senior Engineering & Field Solvency</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Proven Expertise in Critical Power Infrastructure</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Serviproma Energy C.A. is a specialized power engineering firm backed by senior specialists with over 35 years operating in energized bulk substations and 12 years of direct operational leadership in National Grid Load Dispatch and Transmission.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission and Vision -->
  <section class="py-24 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Mission -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex flex-col shadow-xl group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
        <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img 
            src="/images/benchmarks/pace-pruebas-primarios.webp" 
            alt="Engineers performing primary injection tests ensuring grid reliability" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-slate-900/40 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            Operational Commitment
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Our Mission</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              To deliver engineering, commissioning, and maintenance services with maximum excellence, guaranteeing operational continuity and safety across energy infrastructure.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 mt-6 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
            Focus: Excellence · Safety · Reliability
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Vision -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex flex-col shadow-xl group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
        <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img 
            src="/images/benchmarks/pace-sala-tableros.webp" 
            alt="Engineers in front of modern automation and control panels" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-slate-900/40 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            Technological Vanguard
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Our Vision</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              To be recognized as the leading company in engineering, commissioning, and maintenance solutions for the energy sector, distinguished by innovation, safety, and commitment to sustainability.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 mt-6 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
            Focus: Innovation · Safety · Sustainability
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Complete Lifecycle Methodology -->
  <section class="py-24 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/30">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 font-mono">Working Methodology</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">We Cover the Full Project Lifecycle</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3">A disciplined approach from initial site audit to post-energization engineering support.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex flex-col group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="h-32 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              src="/images/benchmarks/pace-ingenieria-oficina.webp" 
              alt="Engineers reviewing single-line diagrams and performing diagnostics" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-950/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">STEP 01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Diagnostics</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Comprehensive assessment of existing installations and forensic audit of field-installed assets.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-3">Site Audit & Scoping</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex flex-col group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="h-32 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              src="/images/benchmarks/pace-cableado-control.webp" 
              alt="Detailed engineering, protection schematics, and wiring schedules" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-950/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">STEP 02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Engineering</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Coordination studies, basic and detailed engineering, logic intertrips, and equipment technical datasheets.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-3">Studies & Schematics</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex flex-col group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="h-32 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              src="/images/benchmarks/pace-pruebas-omicron.webp" 
              alt="Relay parameterization and Omicron secondary injection testing during FAT" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-950/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">STEP 03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Configuration & FAT</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Parameterization of IEDs, SAS, and RTUs with thorough Factory Acceptance Testing before shipment.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-3">Omicron FAT Testing</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex flex-col group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="h-32 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              src="/images/benchmarks/pace-patio-pruebas.webp" 
              alt="Site Acceptance Testing and energization in high-voltage switchyard" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-950/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">STEP 04</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Commissioning (SAT)</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                On-site commissioning, point-to-point dispatch verification, client handover, and live energization support.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-3">SAT Commissioning</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- International Presence & Corporate HQ -->
  <section id="reach" class="py-24 bg-slate-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 font-mono">Global Footprint</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Experience Crossing International Borders</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Our engineering team has executed high-consequence projects and multi-year framework contracts across <strong>6 countries in the Americas and Africa</strong>:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-base">🇻🇪</span> <span class="font-semibold text-white">Venezuela</span> (CORPOELEC, PEQUIVEN)
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-base">🇨🇱</span> <span class="font-semibold text-white">Chile</span> (Elecnor, Transelec, Enel)
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-base">🇨🇴</span> <span class="font-semibold text-white">Colombia</span> (S/E Juana La Avanzadora)
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-base">🇲🇽</span> <span class="font-semibold text-white">Mexico</span> (Thermal plants & industrial)
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-base">🇨🇮</span> <span class="font-semibold text-white">Ivory Coast</span> (Substations & lines)
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-base">🇨🇲</span> <span class="font-semibold text-white">Cameroon</span> (Commissioning & SAS)
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
          <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              src="/images/torre-transmision-ciudad.jpg" 
              alt="Power transmission infrastructure and corporate headquarters" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              Caracas HQ
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Headquarters & Corporate Data</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
              <li><strong class="text-white">Legal Name:</strong> Serviproma Energy C.A.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">Tax ID (RIF):</strong> J-508883055</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">Address:</strong> Av. Las Mercedes, Edif. EXPO 3A, Of. 1-A, Caracas, Venezuela</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">Direct Email:</strong> admin@servipromaenergy.com</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">Direct Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +58 412 725 1017</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
